   "id": "eks-s2",
   "number": "2",
   "text": "(1) If a word or expression used in this regulation is defined in section 119 [definitions for Part 3] of the Act, the word or expression has the same meaning as in that section. (2) For certainty, in this regulation, \"traffic control device\" , in relation to a participating community or the transportation minister, includes a traffic control device placed or erected by a person authorized by the participating community or transportation minister.",
   "part": "Part 1 — Interpretation, Establishment of Pilot Project and General Prohibitions",
   "division": null,
   "heading": "Definitions in section 119 of Act apply"
